      "source_excerpt": "长方形体育场的面积等于 $840\\mathrm{m}^2$。如果把体育场的宽度增加 $4\\mathrm{m}$，长度减少 $5\\mathrm{m}$，那么它的面积不变。求体育场的大小。",
      "domain": "L>5 and W>0 metres ensure both the original and shortened rectangles have positive sides.",
